{"title":"Magma Salamander","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 63 Salamander that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander?lv=63\">Lv 63 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>12</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>63</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>476</td><td>39.2</td><td>3,150</td><td class=\"muted\">1,428 · 54.9 · 9,450</td><td>10</td><td>in the wilds around 194, -1248</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander?lv=64\" title=\"Pick level 64\"><td><b>64</b></td><td>483</td><td>39.7</td><td>3,200</td><td class=\"muted\">1,449 · 55.6 · 9,600</td><td>12</td><td>in the wilds around 187, -1273</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"magma-salamander\" data-map-level=\"63\">Show level 63 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Keepers&#39; Drift</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 3</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-486\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1995.6px,732.6px)\"><i style=\"left:1985.4px;top:-723.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:2033.2px;top:-778.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:2006.4px;top:-740.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:2007.4px;top:-667.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:2002.0px;top:-747.3px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 192, -1259 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 173, -1306 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 244, -1216 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"magma-salamander\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Salamander: <a href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly\">Old Ashbelly</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander\">Ember Salamander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(59)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander\">Cinder Salamander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/salamander-brood-mother\">Salamander Brood Mother</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/c5bc99e82ca0e0daa8a4.svg\" alt=\"Magma Salamander\"></div><h3>Magma Salamander</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>63</b> <span class=\"muted\"